      },
      "rationale": "Chooses the payload the workspace renders: the answer for the subject on screen, or while that subject is pending the last admitted frame of the task context, so the workspace is never unmounted by a selection.",
      "role": "primary-authority"
    },
    {
      "anchor": {
        "blob": "7c6601ddf7269a084e197eb6ae1f071a8c3acef6",
