        }
      },
      "id": "RLZ-32B5MZ",
      "invariant": "INV-NSG0D4",
      "origin": {
        "handoffEntry": "MIK-R39@v1-in-tree-selection-adds-rows",
        "leaf": "260928-MIK-L39"
      },
      "rationale": "Its `selectSubject` begins every selection with `beginSelection(options?.keepTree === true)`, so the walk is kept only for a selection that says it is the selection of a row of the tree.",
      "role": "enforcement"
    },
    {
      "anchor": {
        "blob": "7c6601ddf7269a084e197eb6ae1f071a8c3acef6",
        "content": "sha256:a4cb15f991923645d5bd6bd9654729ebd68da71c047ec096d8112ba5087c5a36",
        "locator": {
          "kind": "symbol",
          "name": "subjectSelection"
        }
      },
      "id": "RLZ-8XHR0Q",
      "invariant": "INV-MWCCQM",
      "origin": {
        "handoffEntry": "MIK-R39@v1-kept-partial-family-stop",
        "leaf": "260928-MIK-L39"
      },
      "rationale": "Its `selectSubject` hands the page named in the selection's options to the read as the selection's page, so the kept family's review is asked with its cursor in the one request of the selection.",
      "role": "propagation-persistence"
    },
    {
      "anchor": {
        "blob": "7c6601ddf7269a084e197eb6ae1f071a8c3acef6",
        "content": "sha256:a4cb15f991923645d5bd6bd9654729ebd68da71c047ec096d8112ba5087c5a36",
